{"seq":2,"slug":"realtime-abuse-scoring-rule-feature","title":"实时滥用评分：规则与特征工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/abuse-detection-graph-signals/realtime-abuse-scoring-rule-feature","wordCount":2886,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"实时滥用评分-规则与特征工程\">实时滥用评分：规则与特征工程</h1><p>领券接口的 P99 预算是 180 毫秒。攻击脚本对这个接口每秒发出 4 万个请求，其中 96% 来自同一批刚从接码平台租来的号段。你必须在请求返回「领取成功」之前决定这 4 万个请求里哪些该放、哪些该拦、哪些该转人工——离线分析再准，跑得不够快就等于没有。实时滥用评分要解决的正是这个「在线决策」问题：把身份、设备、行为、图谱多维信号压缩成一个在几十毫秒内可计算的分数，并给出可解释的处置理由。</p>\n<p>本文聚焦评分<strong>底座</strong>——规则引擎与特征工程如何协作生产这个分数。它上承 <a href=\"../promo-abuse-taxonomy-economics/promo-abuse-taxonomy-attacker-archetypes\">促销滥用分类与攻击者画像</a> 定义的行为体，把定性画像翻译成可计算的信号；下接本章的身份图谱与异常信号、以及第四章的处置护栏。攻击经济学的期望收益模型（见 <a href=\"../promo-abuse-taxonomy-economics/promo-attack-economics-roi-model\">促销攻击经济学与 ROI 模型</a>）决定了单次拦截的价值量级——拦截成本必须显著低于它挡下的补贴损失，否则风控本身会变成亏损项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>实时滥用评分</strong>（real-time abuse scoring）是在一次业务动作发生的同步链路上，用当前请求的上下文与历史累积状态，输出一个风险分与处置决策的过程。它由三个可独立演进的部件组成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>规则引擎（rules）</strong>：确定性判定的集合，形如 <code>if 条件 then 分数/动作</code>。可解释、可审计、可即时热更新。适合表达硬约束（命中已知黑名单设备、券码请求速率超阈值）与合规要求（同一实名证件当日领取上限）。</li>\n<li><strong>特征工程（features）</strong>：把原始事件（领券、下单、登录、地址修改）加工成数值向量。特征决定模型的上限；规则决定下界的安全兜底。实时场景的特征必须满足<strong>可在线计算</strong>——要么在事件流中增量维护（velocity、count、distinct），要么在请求时以低于延迟预算的成本从缓存/图存储读取。</li>\n<li><strong>决策层（decisioning）</strong>：把规则命中与模型分数融合成一个最终风险分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，并映射到动作漏斗（放行 / 加验证 / 限速 / 转人工 / 拦截）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者关系可以这样理解：<strong>规则是显式的领域知识，特征是隐式的行为统计，模型是两者的非线性组合</strong>。生产系统几乎从不只靠模型——监管审计、客服申诉、事故复盘都需要「为什么拦他」的一句话理由，这只能由规则给出。</p>\n<p>一个典型的三级漏斗结构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  R[&quot;领券请求&lt;br/&gt;account/device/ip/coupon&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;在线特征拉取&lt;br/&gt;key-value store + 图查询&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; E[&quot;规则引擎&lt;br/&gt;确定性判定&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; M[&quot;模型打分&lt;br/&gt;GBDT / 逻辑回归 / GNN&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt; D{&quot;风险分 S&lt;br/&gt;阈值分流&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;S &lt; t1&quot;| P[&quot;放行&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;t1 ≤ S &lt; t2&quot;| C[&quot;加验证&lt;br/&gt;短信 / 滑块 / 3DS&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;t2 ≤ S &lt; t3&quot;| T[&quot;限速 / 降额&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;S ≥ t3&quot;| B[&quot;拦截&lt;br/&gt;+ 写回图与黑名单&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; G[&quot;反馈回流&lt;br/&gt;标签 → 重训 → 规则迭代&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n  R[\"领券请求&lt;br/&gt;account/device/ip/coupon\"] --&gt; F[\"在线特征拉取&lt;br/&gt;key-value store + 图查询\"]\n  F --&gt; E[\"规则引擎&lt;br/&gt;确定性判定\"]\n  E --&gt; M[\"模型打分&lt;br/&gt;GBDT / 逻辑回归 / GNN\"]\n  M --&gt; D{\"风险分 S&lt;br/&gt;阈值分流\"}\n  D --&gt;|\"S &lt; t1\"| P[\"放行\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"t1 ≤ S &lt; t2\"| C[\"加验证&lt;br/&gt;短信 / 滑块 / 3DS\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"t2 ≤ S &lt; t3\"| T[\"限速 / 降额\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"S ≥ t3\"| B[\"拦截&lt;br/&gt;+ 写回图与黑名单\"]\n  B --&gt; G[\"反馈回流&lt;br/&gt;标签 → 重训 → 规则迭代\"]\n  G --&gt; E</pre><p>关于延迟预算的工程事实：线上风控的端到端同步链路通常要控制在 <strong>100–300 毫秒</strong>内（与支付授权、3DS 挑战同量级），其中特征拉取往往占用一半以上。这就要求特征存储（feature store）用内存级 key-value（Redis / Aerospike 之类）而非关系库，且图查询要走预计算邻居或本地缓存，不能做深度多跳遍历。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则引擎-表达领域知识\">规则引擎：表达领域知识</h2><p>规则引擎的价值在于<strong>把专家判断变成可热更新、可版本化、可回滚的配置</strong>，而不是散落在代码里的 <code>if</code>。一条促销风控规则通常包含：条件（predicate）、动作（action）、优先级（priority）、有效期（TTL）、命中计数（用于事后评估误报）。</p>\n<p>规则的常见分类，按<strong>证据类型</strong>而非按业务名划分更利于维护：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则类型</th>\n<th>判据来源</th>\n<th>典型示例</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n<th>误报风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>名单类（list）</td>\n<td>外部或历史沉淀</td>\n<td>设备指纹在黑名单、号段在接码段库、地址在批量收货点库</td>\n<td>低（小时级）</td>\n<td>低，但覆盖面受名单新鲜度制约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阈值类（threshold）</td>\n<td>实时计数的静态上界</td>\n<td>单账号 1 小时内领券 &gt; 20 张</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中，需按活动调参</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速率类（velocity）</td>\n<td>滑动窗口速率</td>\n<td>同 IP 段 1 分钟领券 &gt; 500 次</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中高，家庭/公司 NAT 会误伤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性类（consistency）</td>\n<td>字段间关系</td>\n<td>下单 IP 归属地与收货地址国家/州不一致</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中，跨境/代购场景高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列类（sequence）</td>\n<td>事件顺序与时限</td>\n<td>注册后 &lt; 10 秒即领取新客券并下单</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合类（composite）</td>\n<td>多条件与/或</td>\n<td>新账号 + 虚拟号段 + 新设备 + 高价券</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低，精度高但覆盖窄</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>规则引擎的工程要点有三条。<strong>第一，优先级与互斥</strong>：硬拦截规则必须先于加分规则求值，否则低分项会稀释关键命中。<strong>第二，灰度与影子模式</strong>：任何新规则先以影子模式（shadow）跑，只记录不处置，观察命中量与误报到可接受水平再上处置。<strong>第三，每条规则的命中样本必须留存</strong>——没有留存就无法回答「这条规则是不是在误伤真实用户」，也无法做后续的规则淘汰（rule retirement）。</p>\n<p>一条可读的阈值规则示例（DSL 伪代码，非具体厂商语法）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"rule &quot;new_account_high_value_coupon_burst&quot; priority 100&#10;  when account.age &lt; 1h&#10;       and coupon.face_value &gt;= 50&#10;       and count(claim, account, 1h) &gt;= 2&#10;       and device.distinct_accounts_24h &gt;= 5&#10;  then score += 60&#10;       and action = review&#10;  ttl 30d\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>rule \"new_account_high_value_coupon_burst\" priority 100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  when account.age &#x3C; 1h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       and coupon.face_value >= 50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       and count(claim, account, 1h) >= 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       and device.distinct_accounts_24h >= 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  then score += 60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       and action = review</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ttl 30d</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"特征工程-从事件到向量\">特征工程：从事件到向量</h2><p>特征工程是把「行为」翻译成模型能吃的东西。促销风控的特征天然是<strong>时序与关系</strong>密集型的，可归为四族。</p>\n<p><strong>速度型（velocity / aggregation）。</strong> 滑动窗口内的计数、求和、去重计数。它们回答「多快、多密」。实现上用流式聚合（如 Flink 的窗口或 Redis 的 ZSET 计数）增量维护，避免请求时全表扫描。关键陷阱是<strong>时间衰减</strong>：昨天的 50 次领券和刚才 5 秒内的 50 次，权重不该相同。常用做法是指数衰减计数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(t) = \\sum_{i} w_i \\cdot e^{-\\lambda (t - t_i)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 次事件时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制衰减速率。</p>\n<p><strong>关系型（graph / network）。</strong> 通过共享属性把账号、设备、IP、支付工具、收货地址连成图，提取度（degree）、连通分量、邻居风险均值、社区标签等。这部分深度展开在本章的身份图谱文档，此处只强调一点：实时评分只能读<strong>预计算的图特征</strong>（如「该设备关联的可疑账号数」已在图库中物化），不能在同步链路上做多跳遍历。</p>\n<p><strong>内容型（content / metadata）。</strong> 从请求本身抽取，无需历史：设备指纹（canvas/WebGL/字体/时区）、IP 归属地与代理标记（ASN、数据中心段、VPN/Tor 检测）、邮箱/手机号的号段与一次性域名、地址结构合法性与地理编码一致性。这类特征延迟最低，且对新账号同样有效——是冷启动阶段的主力。</p>\n<p><strong>身份型（identity）。</strong> 账号年龄、实名状态、历史履约、历史被处置次数、绑定关系的数量与多样性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征族</th>\n<th>代表特征</th>\n<th>在线来源</th>\n<th>冷启动可用</th>\n<th>主要对抗面</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>速度型</td>\n<td>1h 领券数、5min 同设备下单数</td>\n<td>流式聚合 / Redis ZSET</td>\n<td>否（需历史）</td>\n<td>攻击者降低频率即可规避</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系型</td>\n<td>设备关联账号数、邻居风险均值</td>\n<td>图存储预计算</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>攻击者拆分设备池稀释关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容型</td>\n<td>IP ASN、设备指纹、邮箱域名</td>\n<td>请求时抽取 + 静态库</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>指纹伪造、住宅代理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>身份型</td>\n<td>账号年龄、历史处置、履约数</td>\n<td>用户主数据缓存</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>养号（长期低成本账号）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>特征工程的纪律：<strong>每个特征都要有 owner、更新频率、缺失值语义、区间监控</strong>。线上特征与离线训练特征的口径不一致（training-serving skew）是风控模型最常见的静默故障——训练时用 T+1 全量算的特征，线上却用实时近似值，模型分数会整体漂移而没人发现。对策是<strong>特征平台</strong>同一份定义同时供离线和在线消费，并持续做一致性校验（对比同一实体的在线值与离线回算值）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"融合与校准-分数怎么变成动作\">融合与校准：分数怎么变成动作</h2><p>有了规则命中与模型分数，最后一步是融合与定阈。两种常见范式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>规则优先（rules-first）</strong>：命中硬规则直接给动作，未命中才走模型。可解释性最好，适合合规敏感场景，但规则间的组合覆盖有限。</li>\n<li><strong>打分融合（score blending）</strong>：把规则命中也编码成特征/分值，与模型输出一起进入最终分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>。覆盖面广，但可解释性弱化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个可落地的融合式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>rule</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mtext> 命中</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\sigma\\left( \\alpha \\cdot f_{\\text{model}} + \\sum_{k} \\beta_k \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[\\text{rule}_k \\text{ 命中}] \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rule</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">命中</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{model}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是模型原始输出，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是规则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 的加权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 为压缩函数，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 归一到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>阈值分流</strong>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 映射到动作。冷启动阶段最大的隐患是<strong>基数误报</strong>：即使单条规则误报率只有 1%，当天百万级流量也会产生上万次误伤。因此必须用<strong>精确率约束</strong>来定阈——先确定平台能承受的人工复核量与放行误伤率，反推阈值，而不是先定分数再观察。业务指标上通常监控：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>目标方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拦截精确率</td>\n<td>拦截中真滥用占比</td>\n<td>高（减少误伤）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拦截召回率</td>\n<td>总滥用中被拦截占比</td>\n<td>高（减少漏损）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误伤率（false positive rate）</td>\n<td>真实用户被拦/加验证占比</td>\n<td>低（首要约束）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策延迟 P99</td>\n<td>同步链路耗时</td>\n<td>低于延迟预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则命中漂移</td>\n<td>命中率相对基线的变化</td>\n<td>稳定（突增/突降都是信号）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>融合之外还要处理<strong>对抗性反馈</strong>——攻击者会根据拦截结果调整策略。如果只用静态阈值，攻击者降到阈值以下即可绕过；如果阈值随攻击强度自动收紧，又可能误伤真实用户。稳健做法是<strong>多信号正交</strong>：让不同特征族互相校验（内容型对冷启动，速度型对高频，关系型对规模化），攻击者必须同时伪造所有维度才可能逃逸，而多数地下工具的伪造成本在成本约束下做不到全覆盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>实时滥用评分由<strong>规则引擎 + 特征工程 + 决策层</strong>三件套组成，规则负责可解释的硬约束，特征决定模型上限，决策层融合并映射动作。</li>\n<li>规则按<strong>证据类型</strong>组织（名单 / 阈值 / 速度 / 一致性 / 序列 / 组合），每条规则必须有优先级、TTL、影子模式与命中样本留存。</li>\n<li>特征分四族——速度型、关系型、内容型、身份型；在线特征必须可在延迟预算内算出，且<strong>离线与在线口径必须统一</strong>（training-serving skew 是头号静默故障）。</li>\n<li>融合式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>model</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mtext>rule</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\sigma(\\alpha f_{\\text{model}} + \\sum \\beta_k \\mathbb{1}[\\text{rule}_k])</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">model</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rule</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span></span></span></span></span> 把规则与模型统一进一个分数，阈值分配要由<strong>精确率约束反推</strong>，而非事后拍分。</li>\n<li>反馈回流（拦截标签 → 重训 → 规则迭代）是评分体系持续有效的闭环；没有回流，规则与模型都会随时间失效。</li>\n<li>下节进入身份图谱与异常信号，展开关系型特征的构建与去匿名化对抗；处置动作与预算护栏见第四章。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实时滥用评分：规则与特征工程","id":"实时滥用评分-规则与特征工程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"规则引擎：表达领域知识","id":"规则引擎-表达领域知识"},{"level":2,"text":"特征工程：从事件到向量","id":"特征工程-从事件到向量"},{"level":2,"text":"融合与校准：分数怎么变成动作","id":"融合与校准-分数怎么变成动作"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"身份图谱：设备/支付/收货关联建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/abuse-detection-graph-signals/abuse-identity-graph-device-payment-link"},"next":{"title":"误伤治理与对抗规避：把误报成本与规避成本放进同一本预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/promotion-coupon-abuse-fraud-budget-control/abuse-detection-graph-signals/detection-false-positive-adversarial-evasion"}}